## Case: numpy-zero
id: "py.slicing.1127.numpy-zero"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1127"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.as"
syntax: "auto-script"

```auto
use.py numpy: arange
fn main() int {
    var row = arange(6)
    var zero = 0
    var caught = 0
    try { var bad = row[::zero]; print(bad.tolist().to(str)) } catch e { caught = caught + 1; print(e.to(str)) }
    print(caught)
    print(row[1:4:2].tolist().to(str))
    return 0
}
```

