## Case: bound-error
id: "py.slicing.1127.bound-error"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1127"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.as"
syntax: "auto-script"

```auto
use.py numpy: arange
use.py json: loads
fn mark(label_text str, n int) int {
    print(label_text)
    return n
}

fn main() int {
    var caught = 0
    try {
        var bad = arange(mark("recv", 6))[mark("start", 0):loads("{").to(int):mark("step", 0)]
        print(bad.tolist().to(str))
    } catch e {
        caught = caught + 1
        print(e.to(str))
    }
    print(caught)
    print(arange(3)[::2].tolist().to(str))
    return 0
}
```

